OL,3,GNEWSAGang behind #30m cash-smuggling
OL,4,Aoperation jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of a criminal gang who smuggled
OL,7,Falmost #30m in cash from the UK to
OL,8,FDubai through airports including
OL,9,FManchester and Birmingham have been
OL,10,Fjailed.
OL,12,FPassing sentence at Bolton Crown Court,
OL,13,FJudge Abigail Hudson described the
OL,14,Foffenders as a "shallow group of
OL,15,Findividuals" who "revelled in spending
OL,16,Fobscene amounts of money".
OL,18,FThe judge said those involved were
OL,19,F"fully aware and wholly disinterested"
OL,20,Fthat the cash they were transporting
OL,21,Fcame from serious criminal activity,
OL,22,Foften drug dealing.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
