OL,3,GNEWSAGang behind #30m cash-smuggling
OL,4,Aoperation jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group used Emirates flights
OL,7,Fdeparting from Manchester, Birmingham
OL,8,Fand Brussels airports to transport
OL,9,Fcriminal cash to the United Arab
OL,10,FEmirates between 2017 and 2019.
